<title>MEXICO: Foreign investment in Mexican securities rises.</title>
<headline>Foreign investment in Mexican securities rises.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreign investment in Mexican securities rose 13.35 percent in June to $46.21 billion from $40.77 billion on May 30, the Mexican Stock Exchange said on Monday.</p>
<p>It said foreign investment in stocks rose 14.99 percent to $42.84 billion, while in the money market it fell 4.00 percent to $3.37 billion.</p>
<p>				June 30  May 30   Monthly     Yearly</p>
