<p>Neutral Fund	(2)     5.148   4.163   23.67	 46.80</p>
<p>ADRs		  (3)    21.080  19.105   10.34	 39.53</p>
<p>Mexico Fund	 (4)     1.173   1.054   11.22	 27.43</p>
